&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;Latest release: &lt;strong&gt;v4.0.2&lt;/strong&gt; — &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/Fincept-Corporation/FinceptTerminal/releases/tag/v4.0.2&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
